      "name": "Oily Scales",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>A scalathrax constantly sweats a glistening oil that makes it exceptionally slick. It treats the results of Acrobatics checks to Squeeze or of any skill check to Escape as one degree of success greater than the rolled result.</p>\n<p>A scalathrax loses this benefit for 1 minute after it takes any amount of fire damage.</p>",
